{
  "description": "Maps CoAd pay codes in pay_items to import template columns. Defaults cover codes whose legend description was identical (or nearly) across the 30 batch-2 client legends: 1, 2, 19, 20, 23-28; every other code resolves through the record's own code_legend plus a client override. Only 'Default Earning by Column Import' is populated: its columns were observed in client attachments (e.g. 02030895_069Uy00000p3tsGIAQ). The other two templates are placeholders until their layouts are obtained.",
